r Rose e in quello che ha innalzato nel cuore, Troy è un'onda implacabile che frange i suoi affetti. Inviso al figlio minore, a cui tarpa le ali per proteggerlo dalle discriminazioni razziali, e persuaso dall'amico a prendere una decisione sulla sua (doppia) vita, confessa alla moglie il tradimento e spalanca tra loro un abisso di dolore. Rimasto solo nel cortile del suo scontento, Troy ricompone i brandelli esistenziali e aspetta la morte."},{"language":"en-US","overview":"In 1950s Pittsburgh, a frustrated African-American father struggles with the constraints of poverty, racism, and his own inner demons as he tries to raise a family.","tagline":"Some people build fences to keep people out, and other people build fences to keep people in."}],"images":{"logos":[],"posters":[],"backdrops":[]},"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/oBLylKXnx0YN9X0fs7O4KQzvhlz.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/j2kgVOyp4dxlqohU5QJTrDHfbRD.jpg","seasons":[],"schema":{}}},"artworkLibrary":{"tmdb":{"schemaVersion":1,"source":"tmdb","id":393457,"type":"movie","originalLanguage":"en-US","series":{"poster":{"it":{"status":"available","selected":{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/oBLylKXnx0YN9X0fs7O4KQzvhlz.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/oBLylKXnx0YN9X0fs7O4KQzvhlz.jpg","language":"it","width":2000,"height":3000},"candidates":[{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/oBLylKXnx0YN9X0fs7O4KQzvhlz.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/oBLylKXnx0YN9X0fs7O4KQzvhlz.jpg","language":"it","width":2000,"height":3000},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/8gfi7yqSjxV5EKaKyRM40fJB172.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/8gfi7yqSjxV5EKaKyRM40fJB172.jpg","language":"it","width":2000,"height":3000},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/myrV3M0cM9YXgQkNKOTKqqbCO8O.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/myrV3M0cM9YXgQkNKOTKqqbCO8O.jpg","l